-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",358,{
[11425]="70032BDE\n1\tKill a globsnaga spider\tThe fungal spiders are found in the north-east corner and eastern side of the Redhorn Lodes.\n2\tCollect fungus samples (total: 7)\tThe fungal spiders are found in the north-east corner and eastern side of the Redhorn Lodes.\n3\tReturn to Knakk\tKnakk is camped on the elevated walkway in the north-east corner of Redhorn Lodes. Knakk will be happy to study the samples you've collected of the fungus. He will have to pull himself away from the locket puzzle to analyze it.\n",
[11426]="700164D2\n1\tCollect creature samples (total: 8)\tToads, lizards, and spiders can be found all over the Water-works in Moria. Águti wants to know more about the local wildlife. He asked you to gather samples of the toads, lizards, and spiders of the Water-works.\n2\tTalk to Águti in the Rotting Cellar\030Collect Creature-sample (total: 8)\tÁguti can be found at the Rotting Cellar camp in the Water-works. Águti will want to see the samples while they are still fresh, for he hopes to learn from them.\n",
[11427]="70024BD0\n1\tCollect fresh winterberries from the wild (total: 5)\030Collect eggs from pampered chickens (total: 5)\030Collect pampered mushrooms (total: 5)\030Make fresh bread at the servants' oven (total: 3)\tMushrooms can be found in the mushroom tent outside of Winter-home. Eggs can be found around the chicken coop. Bread must be baked at the ovens. Berries must be picked from the bushes growing in the wild. You should collect each of the items needed to ensure the feast is fully stocked for the patrons.\n2\tBring the foodstuffs to Mabel Mitford\tMabel Mitford is in Winter-home. You should bring all the food that you have collected and baked to Mabel Mitford so that the festival feast will remain plentiful for the hungry patrons.\n",
[11428]="7003505D\n1\tCollect whips from Balewood slave-drivers\t\n2\tCollect whips from Balewood slave-drivers (total: 4)\tBalewood slave-drivers can be found along the Orc-roadway through the Balewood. The Warg-riders of the White Hand may have a great deal of trouble riding out of Balewood if they are tripped by the whips of their allies.\n3\tTie whips to White Hand banners (total: 4)\tWhite Hand banners can be found along the Orc-roadway through the Balewood. You have gathered the whips and should now anchor them to the bases of nearby White Hand banners.\n4\tCompleted\tYou have successfully tripped numerous Warg-riders of the White Hand.\n",
[11429]="7006EB37\n1\tSound alarms at camps (total: 3)\030Extinguish braziers at camps (total: 3)\tYour mission is to cause a disturbance in a cave that is known for its spiders, but is now being occupied by Ekhamâti soldiers. Extinguish the soldiers' fires and sound their alarms to bring the spiders down on them.\n2\tEscape the cave before reinforcements arrive!\tYou have brought the spiders down on the soldiers. Escape before the reinforcements arrive! This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n3\tDefeat Sabragêsh\tSabragêsh is blocking your escape! Defeat her before reinforcements arrive.\n",
[11430]="7002F88F\n1\tTalk to Runald near the southern gate of Elthengels\tRunald and his family can be found with their waggon at the southern entrance to Elthengels. Thane Mildrith has asked you to assist Runald and his family so that they may finish their final preparations in leaving Elthengels safely.\n2\tTalk to Hereléof outside his home in Elthengels\tHereléof can be found at the well in the western section of the village of Elthengels. Runald would like you to ask Hereléof to watch over his home, once he departs.\n3\tTalk to Runald near the south-western gate\tRunald and his family can be found at the southern gate to the village of Elthengels. Hereléof has agreed to look after the home until the day that Runald or his kin may come to reclaim it.\n4\tTalk to Cadsterre, wife of Runald\tCadsterre can be found with her family at the southern gate of Elthengels. Cadsterre would care to ask a favour of you as she prepares to leave her home.\n5\tTalk to Frithnyd by the fountain in Elthengels\tFrithynd can be found contemplating at the fountain in Elthengels, outside the tavern. Cadsterre has asked you to say farewell to Frithynd, as she cannot bear to do so herself, and to inform her of the gift she has left behind.\n6\tReturn to Cadsterre near the gate\tCadsterre can be found with her family at their waggon near the southern gate to Elthengels. Frithynd has asked you to thank Cadsterre for her kindness and friendship and to wish her good fortune upon her journey.\n7\tTalk with Mundsúnu, son of Runald\tMundsunu, son of Runald and Cadsterre, waits at the southern entrance to Elthengels. Like his parents before him, Mundsunu would request a favour of you before leaving his home.\n8\tTalk to Barcyne in Elthengels\tBarcyne can be found at her home in the south-east part of the village of Elthengels. Mundsúnu has asked that you bring his doll to his friend Barcyne.\n9\tReturn to Runald to finalize the preparations\tRunald and his family can be found at their waggon near the southern entrance to Elthengels. With all of the preparations and favours completed, you should speak to Runald one last time before his departure.\n",
[11431]="7006C574\n1\tCollect large chunks of sandstone from the quarry north-west of Jirush ([see journal]/3)\030Collect reeds from the marsh in northern Khûd Zagin ([see journal]/6)\tNangar asked you to collect sandstone to repair the walls of Jirush from the quarry west of the outpost and reeds from the marshland far to the north of Jirush to conceal archers' windows.\n2\tConceal archers' windows in Jirush ([see journal]/6)\030Patch the walls of Jirush ([see journal]/3)\tYou acquired both the sandstone and reeds. Return to Jirush and patch the walls with the sandstone. Then conceal the archers' windows with the reeds.\n3\tTalk to Nangar\tYou completed the patch work and hanging of reeds. You should return to Nangar and let him know the work is complete.\n",
[11432]="70028CA6\n1\tDestroy supply stores (total: 5)\tThe village of Cuvnerth lies to the south-east of Garrun's camp. Garrun asked you to enter the village of Cuvnerth and destroy the supplies they have been stocking.\n2\tTalk to Garrun in the Isendale\tGarrun's camp lies to the west of Cuvnerth. You should return to Garrun with news of your success.\n",
[11433]="7004DD9A\n1\tPlay the Summer Seasonal Instances during the Summer Festival\tSummer Seasonal Instances have arrived! Play Summer Seasonal Instances during the Summer Festival. You can access Summer Seasonal Instances from the Instance Join panel.\n2\tPlay the Summer Seasonal Instances during the Summer Festival\tSummer Seasonal Instances have arrived! Play Summer Seasonal Instances during the Summer Festival. You can access Summer Seasonal Instances from the Instance Join panel.\n",
[11434]="70027215\n1\tUse the horn at Naur-maudhûl to summon Nagrut\tNagrut may be summoned by blowing the horn of challenge in Naur-maudhûl, north of Barnavon. Gwilum asked you to go to Naur-maudhûl and defeat the leader of the Warg-riders, Nagrut.\n2\tDefeat Nagrut at Naur-maudhûl\tNagrut is at Naur-maudhûl, north of Barnavon. Gwilum asked you to defeat Nagrut, the Warg-riders' leader.\n",
[11435]="700571A8\n1\tGather biting insects in Sundergrót (total: 12)\tSundergrót can be found in the Floodfells. You should seek out biting insects in Sundergrót.\n2\tPut biting insects in goblin tents (quantity: see journal)\tSundergrót can be found in the Floodfells. You should seek out goblin tents in Sundergrót.\n",
[11436]="700571A6\n1\tGather gem and ore samples in Sundergrót (total: 12)\tSundergrót can be found in the Floodfells. You should gather gem and ore samples for Náth.\n2\tBring the samples to Náth just outside of Sundergrót\tSundergrót can be found in the Floodfells. You should bring the samples to Náth just outside of Sundergrót.\n",
[11437]="700571A7\n1\tDestroy mining supplies in Sundergrót (total: 12)\tSundergrót can be found in the Floodfells. You should destroy mining supplies in Sundergrót.\n",
[11438]="700571A9\n1\tDispose of mining-bombs in Sundergrót\tSundergrót can be found in the Floodfells. You should dispose of mining-bombs found in Sundergrót.\n2\tDispose of a bomb near the lower bridge in Sundergrót\tSundergrót can be found in the Floodfells. You should dispose of a mining-bomb found near the lower bridge in Sundergrót.\n3\tDispose of another bomb near the lower bridge in Sundergrót\tSundergrót can be found in the Floodfells. You should dispose of another mining-bomb found near the lower bridge in Sundergrót.\n4\tFind the upper bridge in Sundergrót\tSundergrót can be found in the Floodfells. You should find the upper bridge in Sundergrót.\n5\tDispose of a bomb near the upper bridge in Sundergrót\tSundergrót can be found in the Floodfells. You should dispose of a mining-bomb found near the upper bridge in Sundergrót.\n6\tDispose of another bomb near the upper bridge in Sundergrót\tSundergrót can be found in the Floodfells. You should dispose of another mining-bomb found near the upper bridge in Sundergrót.\n",
[11439]="700571A4\n1\tDefeat foes in Sundergrót (total: 20)\tSundergrót can be found in the Floodfells. You should defeat foes in Sundergrót.\n",
[11440]="700087F6\n1\tDefeat Snowreap Sapper (total: 5)\030Defeat Snowreap Guard (total: 5)\tSnowreap-goblins inhabit Grothum, a village they established east of the Isendeep Mine in Arador's End. Ned Claybrick asked you to assail the goblins in their home to deter them from future raids on Hoarhallow.\n2\tReturn to Ned Claybrick at Hoarhallow\tNed Claybrick awaits your return at Hoarhallow, south and west of Grothum. You found the Snowreap-goblins in Grothum and defeated them at their village. You should return to Ned Claybrick with the news.\n",
[11441]="7004338A\n1\tDefeat the Troll Abomination, Dagron\030Defeat the Half-troll Abomination, Muzgásh\tExplore the tunnels and culverts for signs of Faramir.\n",
[11442]="70043390\n1\tDefeat the Troll Abomination, Dagron\030Defeat the Half-troll Abomination, Muzgásh\tExplore the tunnels and culverts for signs of Faramir.\n",
[11443]="700654AD\n1\tRetrieve waterlogged fabric (total: 4)\tTawardan has asked you to retrieve lengths of black sails from the sunken ships in the bay of the Harlond.\n2\tReturn to Tawardan\tYou should bring the waterlogged sail fabric to Tawardan. Tawardan is in the Harlond.\n",
[11444]="70025A52\n1\tCollect containers (total: 6)\tThe wreckage is strewn along the Baranduin, flowing south from the colossus. Gaelnarthan asked you to swim the Baranduin and collect several containers lost from ancient shipwrecks.\n2\tBring the containers to Gaelnarthan\tGaelnarthan is at the colossus, north-west of the lighthouse ruins. Gaelnarthan will want to see the containers you collected from the river-bed.\n",
[11445]="7002658C\n1\tCollect sunken urns (total: 6)\tOrchalwë saw some urns beneath the waves.\n2\tBring the urns to Orchalwë\tOrchalwë will want to look at the vases.\n",
[11446]="70053F22\n1\tGather supplies in Díngarth (total: 8)\tSupplies can be found in Díngarth. You should gather supplies.\n2\tBring the supplies to Amroth in Echad-in-Edhil\tAmroth can be found in Echad-in-Edhil. You should bring the gathered supplies to Amroth.\n",
[11447]="7001ABEA\n1\tReturn the items to Buckley Sheppard\030Collect coin-purses (total: 4)\030Collect workers' tools (total: 6)\tThe brigands with the stolen tools and coin-purses are at the Old Sweetgrass Farm, north-east of Adso's Camp. Buckley Sheppard asked you to recover the tools and coin-purses the brigands stole from the workers at Adso's Camp.\n",
[11448]="7006BF48\n1\tGrab Urmâkhi supplies in Kûr Anzar (total: 12)\tGrab supplies and packs that belong to the innocent residents of Urmâkh as you move through Kûr Anzar.\n2\tBring the stolen packs back to Numûru in Urmâkh\tBring the stolen packs back to Numûru in Urmâkh.\n",
[11449]="700529E1\n1\tCollect the supplies for Arhaim\tThe supplies for Arhaim can be found at the Beorning watchpost between the Gladden Fields and Duskenvale. You should collect the supplies for Arhaim before heading into Duskenvale.\n2\tDeliver the supplies to Garsind\tGarsind, the Chieftain of Arhaim, will accept the supplies. You should deliver the supplies to Garsind in the village of Arhaim.\n",
[11450]="7000A8B5\n1\tCollect crate of supplies\tHarthadril is at the Ranger-encampment in the court of Clorhir, in front of the entrance to the pools of Glinghant, on a higher level of the city. Quartermaster Badhordam has asked you to carry a crate of supplies to Harthadril at the forward position of Clorhir. He recommended that you bring some strong allies to protect you while you are carrying the crate, for Angmarim will surely attempt to disrupt this attempt at resupply.\n2\tTalk to Badhordam\tQuartermaster Badhordam is at Echad Garthadir, the Ranger-encampment at the heart of Annúminas. You have delivered a crate of supplies to Harthadril at the Ranger-camp in Clorhir, the court in front of the entrance to the pools of Glinghant.\n",
[11451]="7000A8B6\n1\tCollect crate of supplies\tBadhordam is at Echad Garthadir, the Ranger-encampment at the heart of Annúminas. Cuguminuial has asked you to carry a crate of supplies to Badhordam, the quartermaster at Echad Garthadir, in Annúminas. She warned you not to get the crate wet and to bring friends who can protect you while you are carrying it. She is worried that unless the Dúnedain control the gate at the courtyard of Gwaelband, you might not be able to find a safe route to Echad Garthadir.\n2\tTalk to Badhordam\tBadhordam is at the Ranger-encampment of Echad Garthadir, in Annúminas. You have delivered a crate of supplies from Tinnudir to Echad Garthadir and should now speak with Badhordam, the quartermaster of the camp.\n",
[11452]="7000A8B7\n1\tCollect crate of supplies\tLegrindavor is at Tirband, the court on the highest level of the city, from which the great watch-tower looks out over Lake Nenuial. Quartermaster Badhordam has asked you to carry a crate of supplies to Legrindavor at the court of Tirband on the highest level of the city.\n2\tTalk to Badhordam\tBadhordam is at Echad Garthadir, the Ranger-encampment in the heart of Annúminas. You have delivered a crate of supplies to Legrindavor at the court of Tirband and should now return to Quartermaster Badhordam.\n",
[11453]="700595DA\n1\tCollect sacks of nails (total: 6)\030Collect woodworking tools\030Collect waggon wheels (total: 4)\030Collect cut wood (total: 3)\tCotfast is located in the central Wildwood. Minda Heathertoes has asked you to go to Cotfast to gather supplies with which to repair her waggon.\n2\tTalk to Minda Heathertoes\tMinda is waiting at Trader's Warf. You should talk to Minda Heathertoes.\n",
[11454]="7005A2E9\n1\tGoods and supplies can be found across Azanulbizar. Valdi has tasked you with gathering meat, furs, and supplies for the army.\t\n2\tReturn to Valdi\tValdi can be found in Amdân. You should return to Valdi.\n",
[11455]="7003FDDF\n1\tConfiscate supplies (total: 10)\tCorsair supplies are spread out throughout the docks.\n",
[11456]="700718E5\n1\tCollect abandoned supplies (total: 6)\030Defeat Wights inside the Crypts of Gadim-ûn (total: 12)\tAndûmu believes there may be more supply caches hidden many years ago inside the Crypts of Gadim-ûn by Ordâkhai soldiers. He has asked you to enter the crypts and search for them. You should also defeat some of the wights while you are there. The entrance to the Crypts of Gadim-ûn is at the north-west end of the hall at Gadim-ûn.\n2\tBring the supplies to Andûmu\tAndûmu believes there may be more supply caches hidden many years ago inside the Crypts of Gadim-ûn by Ordâkhai soldiers. You have gone there at his request and collected supplies, as well as defeating some of the wights. You should return to Andûmu inside the hall at Gadim-ûn.\n",
})
